# What never goes into this repository.

# Athos's promise is that a person's know-how stays on their machine: a project's local store, task logs, local
# databases (with their journal files) and metrics are theirs, not the repo's.
.athos/
*.jsonl
*.db
*.sqlite*
METRICS.md

# Anything that may hold a secret: every dotenv file, whatever its suffix.
.env*

# Python leftovers: bytecode, virtual environments, and the caches and coverage data tools write beside the code.
# The repo has no packaging step, so there is no build output to ignore.
__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
.*_cache/
.coverage*

# Editor and OS clutter (vim swap files included).
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sw[po]

# Demo recordings: only the GIFs that the README and the docs show are kept.
demo/*.gif
!demo/athos-claude-to-codex.gif
!demo/codex-lawyer-en.gif
!demo/opencode-pii-en.gif
!demo/desktop-finance-en.gif
!demo/opencode-finance-en.gif
!demo/codex-finance-en.gif
!demo/muse-finance-en.gif
!demo/gallery-en.gif
!demo/desktop-gallery-dd-en.gif
!demo/memory-en.gif
